    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="fbd2f816-a286-585f-8e45-8a0f9192af96" activityNameId="e2e303f4-9e1b-544d-89ad-8d626d187cb3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, maintenance, port</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, maintenance, port
Land use is further distingished in built up area (0.6%), road area (sealed area) (45.6%) and water bodies (54.29%).  Emission to waters include emission from production sites on the port site, which are not directly connected to the the transport activities.;
UUID: b973dd9f-ac42-3fe6-815f-d1ede1c7cc3b
This inventory includes emissions of to water due to non removed oil spills.  Land occupation and transformation are taken into account. Energy consumption at the port is based on assumptions for the specifice electricty consumption at the port in Hamburg. 
Location: Data refers to one port in Europe.
Technology: unknown
Time period: Land use data represents conditions in 2002.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature studies and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b973dd9f-ac42-3fe6-815f-d1ede1c7cc3b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
